      "Status": "warn",
      "Evidence": "CorpoNations (Eigenlift, ArcSec, Arcturus), nanites-as-Behemoths, and a systemic gray-zone economy (scavs, Nzambe, GLMZ run) are all richly textured, and the Behemoth is clearly an agent with stakes, not a tool. But the Schism is never mentioned or implied at all, and neuretics appear only glancingly (\u0027No neuretics \u2014 too young for the mesh\u0027) without establishing what they do or the social/economic divide they create.",
